  "27": {
    "inputs": {
      "text": "The Floor-length curtains should hang from a stainless steel curtain rod mounted above the window. Ensure:\n\nTriple pinch pleats at the top with deep, crisp, uniform folds all the way down.\n\nFabric must appear slightly thick, not sheer, with natural drape and realistic depth.\n\nThere should be a small opening in the middle, revealing part of the window.\n\nThe curtain rod must stay fully visible above the pleats and must not intersect or disappear into the fabric.\n\nThe fabric texture should accurately wrap and deform across the pleats and folds, maintaining sharpness and realism.\n\nLighting, shadows, and reflections must match the lighting of the room image.\n\nFinal output should look high-resolution, photorealistic, seamlessly integrated into the real scene."
    },
    "class_type": "Text Multiline",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Prompt 1"
